title: Commvault Job %s
agents: commvault_rest
catalog: app/other
license: GPLv2
distribution:
description:
 Evaluates the backup jobs of one subclient within the lookback period of
 the special agent (default 7 days). The state is taken from the status of the
 last finished job (Completed OK, Completed with warnings/errors WARN,
 Committed WARN, Failed/Killed CRIT, other WARN - all configurable in the
 ruleset "Commvault jobs per subclient"). Running jobs are shown with progress
 and runtime. Optionally the age of the last successful job can be checked.

 If no job ran within the lookback period the service goes WARN
 (configurable). SQL transaction log jobs are not evaluated yet. Restore jobs
 and jobs without subclient (aux copy, DDB, data aging) are ignored.

item:
 "<client> / <agent> [/ <instance>] [/ <backup set>] / <subclient>"; default instance and default backup set are omitted.

discovery:
 One service per subclient that had at least one backup job within the lookback period.
